        "message": "=Hi Ifra,\n\nA new lead has been qualified by your AI Lead Qualification System.\n\n\n<h2>🚀 New {{$node[\"Code in JavaScript\"].json.lead_score}} Lead</h2>\n\n<p><strong>👤 Name:</strong> {{$node[\"Code in JavaScript\"].json.name}}</p>\n\n<p><strong>📧 Email:</strong> {{$node[\"Code in JavaScript\"].json.email}}</p>\n\n<p><strong>📱 Phone:</strong> {{$node[\"Code in JavaScript\"].json.phone}}</p>\n\n<p><strong>🏢 Company:</strong> {{$node[\"Code in JavaScript\"].json.company}}</p>\n\n<p><strong>💼 Service:</strong> {{$node[\"Code in JavaScript\"].json.service}}</p>\n\n<p><strong>💰 Budget:</strong> {{$node[\"Code in JavaScript\"].json.budget}}</p>\n\n<p><strong>📝 Project:</strong><br>{{$node[\"Code in JavaScript\"].json.message}}</p>\n\n<p><strong>⭐ Lead Score:</strong> {{$node[\"Code in JavaScript\"].json.lead_score}}</p>\n\n<p><strong>📋 Reason:</strong><br>{{$node[\"Code in JavaScript\"].json.reason}}</p>\n\n<p><strong>🎯 Next Action:</strong><br>{{$node[\"Code in JavaScript\"].json.next_action}}</p>\n<p>The lead has also been saved to your Google Sheets CRM.</p>\n\n<p><em>This email was sent automatically by your AI Lead Qualification System.</em></p>\n\n\n\n",
        "options": {
